<title>POLAND: FARMFOOD NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>FARMFOOD NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.21 vs   0.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.78 vs   0.71</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.37 vs   1.54</p>
<p> Sales		   17.15 vs  14.84</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.65 vs  11.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	12.93 vs  11.13</p>
<p> Operating profit    19.68 vs  17.09</p>
<p> Sales		  185.66 vs 141.41</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food producer is Farm Food SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
